  "title": "Pollo (Chicken) Fricassee from Puerto Rico",
  "description": "This recipe is how to make Puerto Rican pollo (chicken) fricassee — slow-cook drumsticks and potatoes in a purée of bell peppers, onion, and cilantro.",
